    "intro_narrative": "The sudden disappearance of private investigator Arthur Black has left the city's underbelly in chaos. You've broken into his abandoned office, a room thick with dust and the smell of stale tobacco. Arthur was on the verge of cracking a massive case involving a local smuggling ring, but his crucial findings are locked away behind a series of cryptic devices and hidden safes. The clock is ticking—the same dangerous people who made Arthur disappear are likely coming to destroy his files. Your objective is to follow his trail of breadcrumbs, piece together his scattered evidence, and recover his final, damning document before the truth is lost forever.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
